            "review_title": "Review at The Six Cocktail Bar & Eatery",
            "review_text": "Phoebe S\n1 contribution\n0\nLovely place with great music\nNov 2024 • Family\nMy cousin took us here for our family reunion after 13 years in Saigon. The food was awesome, my husband loved the lamb chops and crab spaghetti. I love everything about the decor, the atmosphere, the food , the drinks and especially the music. We came back the following Thursday for the music 😍\nWritten December 2, 2024",
