            "review_title": "Review at The Six Cocktail Bar & Eatery",
            "review_text": "Chau L\n22 contributions\n0\nGreat chill place for a cocktail lover.\nMay 2024 • Friends\nI went to The Six Cocktail Bar & Eatery for a friend birthday last month and a few times in the weekdays with my close friends. This spot is not only great for an early happy hour but also so much fun for a party night. Food and drink is great and beautiful. Staff and bartenders are young but very patient. My friends and I came and ordered our salad with no cheese once. They took noted and remember that detail for our next visits. By the way, their salad is amazing. I really love their high ceiling with olives trees decoration. Love the walls as well. 🫶\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 2, 2024",
